<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for May Day holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for May Day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's stock market was closed on Thursday because of the May Day holiday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Colombo Stock Exchange all share price index closed 12.18 points up at 739.50 in heavy trade which was led by across the board local buying.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
